cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "mesa-ibi-scanner"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it and the companion MESA paper."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Kumar
    given-names: Uddeshya
version: 0.3.2
date-released: "2026-09-15"
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/uddeshya-world/mesa-ibi-scanner"
abstract: >-
  Research prototype that evaluates MESA Invariant 1 (directed inbound trifecta
  closure Cl(b)) over a typed agent/service interaction graph, with topology JSON
  ingestion and CI-friendly text/JSON/SARIF output. Not for production policy
  enforcement. Companion ACM and topology JSON Schemas included.
keywords:
  - agentic-security
  - multi-agent
  - least-agency
  - interaction-boundary
  - ensemble-trifecta
  - MESA
